{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">加沙停火協議生效，以色列仍繼續對加沙地帶發動襲擊。土耳其電視台TRT報道，汗尤尼斯是其中一個持續遇襲的城市。被形容為所謂安全區的馬瓦西地區，再次遭到以色列攻擊。以軍針對加沙南部，再次殺害巴勒斯坦人，包括兒童、長者及婦女。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 GAZA\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026twphYn2Tnj1789379747.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 GAZA\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>民眾籲國際社會結束殺戮</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">巴勒斯坦人呼籲口稱和平的國際社會，切實結束這場殺戮。加沙民眾表示，他們對那些談論停火的人已不再抱有任何信心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 GAZA\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026rYqiYN02Di1789379761.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 GAZA\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>停火一年內被違反超過4300次</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">報道指出，停火在一年內被違反超過4,300次。加沙各地每天仍可聽到新的爆炸聲和救護車警笛聲，局勢未見平息。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260915 GAZA\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026xmvnMOBEFg1789379777.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260915 GAZA\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T01:49:53.313754+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}